"Uh... never mind. I'm sure it was just a monkey come down from the mountains. Happens now and then. They get lost, or come looking for mushrooms. Hahaha!"

//【ｅｔｃ／おっさん】
<voice name='ｅｔｃ／おっさん' class='その他男声' src='voice/ma01/0090090e009'>
